1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,791
Claude banned 11.4 million accounts in six months.

2
00:00:02,811 --> 00:00:05,370
Only 42,000 appeals succeeded.

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,741
It comes from Anthropic's own transparency page,

4
00:00:07,761 --> 00:00:10,240
updated July 23, covering January to June.

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:13,280
In the second half of last year it was 1.45 million.

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,182
The help center lists three reasons for a ban:

7
00:00:15,202 --> 00:00:17,949
repeated violations, signing up from an unsupported location,

8
00:00:17,969 --> 00:00:19,660
and breaking the terms.

9
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,619
An official September report: accounts suspected of resale,

10
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:24,422
or running from unsupported countries like China,

11
00:00:24,442 --> 00:00:27,230
can be asked to verify identity. Fail, and they are banned.

12
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,140
The South China Morning Post reported on October 2:

13
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,100
on the first day of the holiday,

14
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,286
a wave of complaints on X and Reddit said accounts used

15
00:00:32,306 --> 00:00:34,760
with VPNs were suddenly deactivated.

16
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,020
Blogger @AYi_AInotes says the killer

17
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,250
is a mismatched time zone.

18
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:38,653
Blogger @LawrenceW_Zen says IP

19
00:00:38,673 --> 00:00:40,280
and time zone don't matter.

20
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,096
Opposite claims. The official side has published no numbers

21
00:00:43,116 --> 00:00:44,860
for this wave, and no criteria.

22
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:47,590
So no tutorial is insurance.

23
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:49,764
If banned, the official page gives two routes: log

24
00:00:49,784 --> 00:00:52,301
in and appeal, or export your data and delete the account.

25
00:00:52,321 --> 00:00:54,250
Payments are generally not refunded.

26
00:00:54,270 --> 00:00:57,060
The account is rented. The code has to be yours.
